<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a><main class="wrap inner-page call-page academy-main" id="main-content"><section class="academy-page-hero"><div class="academy-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href='/resources'>Explore MBK</a></div><div class="academy-kicker">contact <span> / MBK GLOBAL</span></div><h1 class="page-title">Let’s make your<br><em>next idea happen.</em></h1><p class="intro">Tell me what you’re working on, what’s getting in the way, and what success looks like. I’ll use the details to understand whether I’m the right person to help.</p></section>
<section class="call-hero">
<div class="call-hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">MBK GLOBAL / LET’S CONNECT</p><p class="call-kicker">A GOOD PROJECT STARTS WITH A GOOD CONVERSATION.</p><div class="call-pills"><span>Websites &amp; web apps</span><span>AI &amp; automation</span><span>APIs &amp; SEO</span></div></div>
<aside class="call-side-card"><span class="call-card-label">THE FIRST STEP</span><div class="call-number">01 <span>/ 03</span></div><h2 id="section-1">Clear goals.<br>Useful next steps.</h2><p>A focused conversation about your needs, priorities and possible approach — without pressure or unnecessary jargon.</p><ul><li>Discuss your goals</li><li>Identify priorities</li><li>Agree on next steps</li></ul></aside>
</section>
<div class="call-layout">
<section class="call-form-panel"><div class="call-panel-heading"><p class="eyebrow">CALL REQUEST</p><h2 id="section-2">Tell me a little about it.</h2><p>Fields marked with * are required. This form prepares a request for you to review and send; it does not reserve a calendar slot automatically.</p></div>
<form class="contact-form call-form" id="call-request">
<div class="call-fields-two"><div><label for="name">Your name *</label><input autocomplete="name" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Full name" required></div><div><label for="email">Email address *</label><input autocomplete="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required type="email"></div></div>
<div class="call-fields-two"><div><label for="phone">WhatsApp / phone (optional)</label><input autocomplete="tel" id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="+country code" type="tel"></div><div><label for="topic">What would you like to discuss? *</label><select id="topic" name="topic" required><option value="Website or web app">Website or web app</option><option value="AI or automation">AI or automation</option><option value="API development or integration">API development or integration</option><option value="SEO or website improvements">SEO or website improvements</option><option value="Cybersecurity or technical review">Cybersecurity or technical review</option><option value="Digital branding">Digital branding</option><option value="Collaboration / other">Collaboration / other</option></select></div></div>
<div class="call-fields-two"><div><label for="budget">Estimated budget (optional)</label><select id="budget" name="budget"><option value="Not decided">Not decided yet</option><option>Under US$100</option><option>US$100–250</option><option>US$250–500</option><option>US$500+</option><option>Discuss first</option></select></div><div><label for="time">Preferred day / time (optional)</label><input id="time" name="time" placeholder="e.g. weekday evening, PKT"></div></div>
<label for="details">What are you hoping to achieve? *</label><textarea id="details" name="details" placeholder="A short overview, key features, current website (if any), target launch date, or the main problem you want to solve." required rows="5"></textarea>
<label class="call-consent"><input id="confirm" required type="checkbox"> <span>I’ve checked my details and understand this sends a request, not a confirmed booking.</span></label>
<div class="call-submit-row"><button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Continue to WhatsApp <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><span class="call-secure-note">No payment required to send a request.</span></div><p aria-live="polite" id="form-note" role="status">WhatsApp will open with your request details prefilled. Review the message and press Send to submit it.</p>
</form></section>
<aside class="call-details"><div class="call-detail-block"><p class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</p><h2 id="section-3">Simple from the start.</h2><ol class="call-steps"><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Share the context</strong><p>Tell me about your project, goals and constraints.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Review the request</strong><p>WhatsApp opens with the details you entered; review them and press Send.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Confirm a time</strong><p>A time is only confirmed after we agree on it directly.</p></div></li></ol></div><div class="call-detail-block call-topics"><p class="eyebrow">GOOD TOPICS FOR A CALL</p><h3 id="section-4">Bring a question, a challenge, or an idea.</h3><p>Planning a new website? Connecting an API? Improving search visibility? Exploring an AI workflow? We can start with the problem and work toward practical next steps.</p></div><div class="call-detail-block call-links"><p class="eyebrow">FIND ME ONLINE</p><a href="https://about.me/muhammadbakhtawar" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">About.me profile <span>↗</span></a><a href="https://linktr.ee/bakhtawark085" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Linktree &amp; social links <span>↗</span></a><a href='/contact'>Contact page <span>↗</span></a></div></aside>
</div>
<section class="call-bottom-note"><span class="call-bottom-mark">MBK</span><div><h2 id="section-5">Not sure where to start?</h2><p>That’s okay. Describe the outcome you want, even if the solution isn’t clear yet.</p></div><a class='button button-secondary' href='/contact'>Explore contact options ↗</a></section>

<script>
document.getElementById('call-request').addEventListener('submit', function(e) {
  e.preventDefault();
  if (!this.reportValidity()) return;
  const f = new FormData(this);
  const val = key => String(f.get(key) || '').trim();
  const message = [
    'Hello Bakhtawar Khan (MBK),', '',
    'I would like to request a call / project discussion.', '',
    'Name: ' + val('name'),
    'Email: ' + val('email'),
    'WhatsApp / Phone: ' + (val('phone') || 'Not provided'),
    'Topic: ' + val('topic'),
    'Budget: ' + (val('budget') || 'Not specified'),
    'Preferred day/time: ' + (val('time') || 'Not specified'), '',
    'Project details:', val('details'), '',
    'I understand this is a request, not a confirmed calendar booking.'
  ].join('\n');
  const note = document.getElementById('form-note');
  if (note) note.textContent = 'Opening WhatsApp with your request. Review the message and press Send to submit it.';
  window.open('https://wa.me/923200276941'+ '?text=' + encodeURIComponent(message), '_blank', 'noopener,noreferrer');
});
</script>
